  "notes": "Released with an instruct version, Mixtral 8x7B Instruct (supervised fine-tuning and direct preference optimisation). At launch Mistral served it behind the mistral-small endpoint of la Plateforme (beta); on 2024-02-26 the changelog renames that endpoint open-mixtral-8x7b (aka mistral-small-2312). The paper (arXiv 2401.04088) says it has the same architecture as Mistral 7B except that each layer has 8 feedforward experts; that describes the architecture, not a derivation, so no derived-from relation is recorded. The docs page links https://legal.mistral.ai/ai-governance/models/mixtral-8-7b, which returns 404."
